[{"client_msg_id":"dd7b4099-f38a-42c9-a37f-1b587e6ae9cb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあ一応 language server 側で頑張ることはできるようです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/tennashi/lsp_spec_ja#completion-request\u003e\n↑これの \"CompletionItem\" で、label や insertText を使うのではなくて textEdit を使うようにすれば、「カーソルからさかのぼってこの文字まで消して、代わりにこの文字列を挿入する」みたいなことができます。\nそれを使えば iskeyword とかは関係なく、「この範囲がユーザの入力途中の文字列だから、ここだけ置き換えますよ」と指定できるわけですね。\nただそのために実装が若干複雑にはなりますが。","ts":"1625835299.253100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"tennashi/lsp_spec_ja","id":1,"title":"tennashi/lsp_spec_ja","text":"LSP 仕様の日本語訳","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"110","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"2 months ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625835347.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Me"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0187b059-7283-46d8-bd1e-b298b2551206","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、やってみて調節するしかない面あるから...とはいえちょっと厳しめ","ts":"1625835172.251600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sjL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c9a7e71-06c3-49b4-8559-33c60d41846a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"MSにとってはどうでもいい部分があるんでしょうね","ts":"1625835158.251100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJYN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9091af33-1add-4758-8011-1f65b5251303","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"LSP コンセプトはいいんだけど細かいところが世の中にいろんなテキストエディタがあるってことを考慮していない感じがしてつらい","ts":"1625835125.250400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yit"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ecbc09e-f0bf-4291-be7a-e635be48a0af","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これは LSP の仕様が中途半端だからってのはある。","ts":"1625835037.249800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3zI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3b8d60d-ca37-4db7-a241-48a0d6691733","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"だいたいの場合、開始位置の不整合が原因。","ts":"1625834997.249000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uPx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44ff2c42-603c-43eb-90fa-c4c3c38e7955","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"iskeyword によって挙動変わりますねー。\ncss の中に `:` とか `-` とか入るし、deno は `/` 入るし。","ts":"1625831589.247900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vs1n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d62906e-d780-406d-94af-0ab41e94ce60","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"VSCode には単語境界となる文字みたいなのを設定する項目があった気がします。実際の動作は確かめてませんが","ts":"1625831168.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cPSL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"876d3ce3-3987-429f-9869-954eaef57ae9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimのiskeywordは独特だと思うが他のエディタにも似たような物があったりするんですかね","ts":"1625831092.245900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eXHvq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e14d1996-65d7-444e-9ccf-5bb336fe217f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"補完はハマりどころあると思います。エディタや設定によって挙動が変わることがあるので。\nVim だとたぶん iskeyword によって挙動代わったりするんじゃなかろうか（これも client によって異なるかも）","ts":"1625831041.244900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LYF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7100179d-a1be-4e63-a673-593545c898fc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"補完は難しい","ts":"1625827643.243700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oaM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01ae3d67-d53b-45cf-b1b4-75429cc063dc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"補完するとテキストがぶっ壊れる LS あるな…","ts":"1625826594.243500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tgU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7b953ae-b0b4-456f-b0d7-24da13319df9","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"oh…","ts":"1625825953.243000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sca/S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56b3c33e-83ae-4a26-9cd4-aa189e9b0336","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"_これ、実はさらに奥が深い問題が潜んでいたりします。。。この状態だと `.` は「入力済みテキスト」となるので、フィルタ処理で `.` はマッチしなくても問題ない。としないと `[Symbol]` はフィルタされてしまう_","ts":"1625825921.242800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZIU9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ab9a3a3-c064-4dbd-8e2e-6ef0a8da2afa","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"諦めることも可能だとは思います。その場合は「選択後に `\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;` などで確定したら期待したテキストになる」という体験になりますね。","ts":"1625825780.241900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BDw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"957d31c9-04ae-4e78-a7d5-86c98f9bf058","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"なんでこんなややこしいことをしているかというと、vim の場合はなるべくなら「選んだだけで期待するテキストになる」という体験を維持したいからです。（coc.nvim がこれを頑張っているので、頑張りたくなる）","ts":"1625825745.241400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CYWr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"621ea279-75e3-4cb0-8e2c-fac41bbd8bcf","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"fmfm","ts":"1625825743.241300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9mThE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7900b6a0-b9a6-4bc3-8bdc-cc2211b03a19","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これ、何が起こってるかというと\n1. LSP サーバのレスポンスを受信する\n2. 各種アイテムに対する `v:completed_item.word` を決める（その結果 `catch/finally/then/[Symbol]` と、自分のプラグインはした）\n3. `[Symbol]` は textEdit を持っていて、その開始位置が `.` の手前になっているので、他のアイテム `catch/finally/then` に `.` を足してやる必要がでてくる\n4. 全部合わせると `[Symbol]` は `.` を上書きし、`catch/finally/then` は `.catch/.finally/.then` になって、きれいに動く","ts":"1625825674.240200","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1625825699.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JpY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ba57d72-6589-4aba-a08f-41167c38d9bd","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"tsuquyomi さん Symbolの候補が出ないw","ts":"1625825545.237700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f5B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e38d17-51ee-48bd-a6ba-05142ae73fd0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"お、なるほどー。","ts":"1625825530.237400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Bie"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29694372-8e3d-4cdd-b572-9a088694212e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いいえ、これは typescript-language-server です","ts":"1625825524.237200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXOu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9682e67b-ad2e-4c9c-b5c9-6e327485915b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"これ coc-tsserver ですか？","ts":"1625825510.236900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wwxf1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e90a6fc-bbe4-4f35-9dcd-3a0b6bc0ca2f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"細かすぎて不具合点が伝わらないGIF(自分はだいたいはわかりますが)\nというかSymbolが `[]` を伴なうのがちょっと不思議w","ts":"1625825475.236600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LDWz"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"\u003c#CLKR04BEF|plugins\u003e で少し触れた点について、どうややこしいのかが伝わりそうな映像を用意してみたので興味がありましたら :bow:\n注目ポイントは `Symbol` を選んだ状態で `Promise.resolve().[Symbol]` ではなく `Promise.resolve()[Symbol]` になっているという点ですｗ　細かすぎて伝わらないかもしれません。","ts":"1625825345.235300","files":[{"id":"F027KTF50AF","created":1625825263,"timestamp":1625825263,"name":"Kapture 2021-07-09 at